{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-01","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L214","english_research_meaning":"Model A keeps operations as direct Python functions and human scripts; its low maintenance cost is real, while machine discovery and stable identity remain unprovided.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-01","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"ALTERNATIVE_A","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-02","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L222","english_research_meaning":"Model B assigns independent identities/lifecycles to five overlapping Command/Operation/Scenario/Cascade/Scheme types; repeated semantics and owner drift make this costly.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-02","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"ALTERNATIVE_B","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-03","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L230","english_research_meaning":"Model C lets human Scenario and Cascade own composition and treats Scheme as AI description; it is near the current UI but risks making machine procedure depend on changing UI definitions.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-03","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"ALTERNATIVE_C","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-04","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L238","english_research_meaning":"Model D favors one subject-capability owner, reusable composition and separate human/AI projections, while requiring typed binding discipline.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-04","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"ALTERNATIVE_D_PREFERRED_BY_RESEARCH","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-05","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L246","english_research_meaning":"Model E treats a full external workflow engine/formalism as ontology; rich scheduling trades off platform dependency and overhead for simple Python analytics.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-05","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"ALTERNATIVE_E","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-06","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L254","english_research_meaning":"The five-model comparison was explicitly qualitative expert judgment, NOT an executed benchmark or an established ranking from measured user workloads.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-06","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"EVALUATION_LIMIT","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-07","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L337","english_research_meaning":"A Python import/function name and a stable domain Operation ID are different identities; module refactoring need not change analytical meaning.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-07","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"SEMANTIC_STABILITY","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-08","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L341","english_research_meaning":"A large Cascade UI category does not inherently require a third execution engine beyond reusable compositions.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-08","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"ENGINE_NONSEQUITUR","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-09","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L343","english_research_meaning":"Machine discoverability never grants execution authorization; schema description, principal privileges and effects must be checked separately.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-09","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"SECURITY_BOUNDARY","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-10","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L532","english_research_meaning":"A simple AI-facing Scheme projection of an Operation ordinarily needs no separate Scheme identity; changing button wording does not change economic method revision.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-10","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"SCHEME_PROJECTION_CASE","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-11","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L549","english_research_meaning":"A Scheme identity can be justified by independently reusable method/policy semantics, tests and governance beyond merely rendering one Operation differently.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-11","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"SCHEME_INDEPENDENT_OWNER_CASE","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-12","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L615","english_research_meaning":"A Cascade used only as a named navigational grouping is a collection, not a runnable composition.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-12","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"CASCADE_CATALOG_CASE","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
{"unit_id":"SB-MAT-0554-ONT-13","source_id":"SB-SRC-0554","source_blob_sha":"ffe6e24dfa3e542f278b7afa3dbeff09b637b935","source_span":"L617","english_research_meaning":"An executable Cascade can be a shared composition of operations, not an intrinsically different solver or executor.","science_id":"SB-SRC-0554/ONT-13","science_destination":"docs/science/capabilities/composition-identity-and-user-machine-projections.md","source_language":"ru","epistemic_status":"LATE_RESEARCH_ONTOLOGY_ALTERNATIVE_NOT_PRODUCT_APPROVED","disposition":"CASCADE_COMPOSITION_CASE","independent_review":"OPEN","source_material_state":"unaccounted","original_user_comment_basis":"RESEARCH_ONLY_OR_PRIMARY_TEXT_SOME_WITH_RAW_DOCX_SHA_UNVERIFIED"}
